{"lyrics":"[00:10.76](Murda On The Beat, So It's Not Nice)\n[00:12.90]Remember when I met her at the dance? (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:15.86]She was cool (She was cool), but her best friend was cooler (Cooler)\n[00:19.86]I'm tryna go back to my class (To my class)\n[00:22.44]Rich as hell (Rich as fuck), just to fuck on my tutor (Tutor)\n[00:26.12]Run up, you get two to the back (Pew-pew)\n[00:28.98]Catch a shell (Tu-tu-tu), from the front of my Ruger (Ruger)\n[00:32.70]I'ma hit that bitch from the back (Hell yeah)\n[00:35.52]Give her hell (Hell yeah), then I put her in the Uber\n[00:39.20]I remember back in math class, high as hell, tryna flirt with my tutor\n[00:45.76]I know that my love never last, oh well, time to hit on a cougar\n[00:52.22]Better watch your mom, lil' nigga, caught her lookin' at my Gucci shoes (Uh-huh)\n[00:58.74]Better watch your mom, lil' nigga 'fore I show her what these Gucci's do (Uh-huh)\n[01:04.84]Hey, every time I get high as hell (Hell yeah)\n[01:08.20]I act a fool (Hell yeah), I don't know no better (Yeah)\n[01:11.60]Hey, every time I get drunk as hell (Uh-huh)\n[01:14.76]I act a fool (Hell yeah), then I get your bitch wetter, hey (Wetter)\n[01:18.54]Remember when I met her at the dance? (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:21.18]She was cool (She was cool), but her best friend was cooler (Cooler)\n[01:25.16]I'm tryna go back to my class (To my class)\n[01:27.74]Rich as hell (Rich as fuck), just to fuck on my tutor (Tutor)\n[01:31.46]Run up, you get two to the back (Pew-pew)\n[01:34.28]Catch a shell (Tu-tu-tu), from the front of my Ruger (Ruger)\n[01:38.08]I'ma hit that bitch from the back (Hell yeah)\n[01:40.82]Give her hell (Hell yeah), then I put her in the Uber\n[01:44.42]Told her I was meeting her in Hell (Up in Hell)\n[01:47.32]Now I'm here (I'm here), but I really don't see her (See her)\n[01:51.02]Remember when I broke her heart (Her heart)\n[01:54.18]Oh, well (Well), so sad, wouldn't wanna be her (Be her)\n[01:57.68]I feel like I'm Bobby (Yeah), Brown (Yeah), Ike Turner (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:02.02]But I would never beat her (Beat her)\n[02:04.06]You know I'm gon' ball, I get goals, ha (Yeah), no Derek Jeter (No Derek Jeter)\n[02:10.72]I'm on top of my game (Game), can't stop me (Stop me)\n[02:14.10]I am not a Rolex (Rolex), can't watch me (Watch Me)\n[02:17.32]I am not a Hublot (Hublot), can't clock me (Clock Me)\n[02:20.40]But I got a gun card (Gun card), come Glock me (Glock me)\n[02:23.78]Remember when I met her at the dance? (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:26.48]She was cool (She was cool), but her best friend was cooler (Cooler)\n[02:29.96]I'm tryna go back to my class (To my class)\n[02:33.06]Rich as hell (Rich as fuck), just to fuck on my tutor (Tutor)\n[02:36.74]Run up, you get two to the back (Pew-pew)\n[02:39.58]Catch a shell (Tu-tu-tu), from the front of my Ruger (Ruger)\n[02:43.32]I'ma hit that bitch from the back (Hell yeah)\n[02:46.12]Give her hell (Hell yeah), then I put her in the Uber (Uber)","words":[[10.76,10.98,"(Murda"],[11.18,11.26,"On"],[11.3,11.34,"The"],[11.52,11.68,"Beat,"],[11.84,11.92,"So"],[12.06,12.16,"It's"],[12.3,12.48,"Not"],[12.66,12.82,"Nice)"],[12.9,13.32,"Remember"],[13.48,13.62,"when"],[13.66,13.66,"I"],[13.84,14.04,"met"],[14.08,14.26,"her"],[14.32,14.42,"at"],[14.48,14.54,"the"],[14.66,15.12,"dance?"],[15.26,15.38,"(Yeah,"],[15.44,15.66,"yeah)"],[15.86,15.96,"She"],[16.04,16.14,"was"],[16.26,16.58,"cool"],[16.7,16.82,"(She"],[16.88,16.98,"was"],[17.08,17.44,"cool),"],[17.56,17.68,"but"],[17.74,17.82,"her"],[17.96,18.18,"best"],[18.3,18.48,"friend"],[18.52,18.62,"was"],[18.72,19.28,"cooler"],[19.6,19.8,"(Cooler)"],[19.86,19.96,"I'm"],[20.0,20.1,"tryna"],[20.14,20.22,"go"],[20.4,20.66,"back"],[20.74,20.82,"to"],[20.92,21.04,"my"],[21.12,21.66,"class"],[21.72,21.84,"(To"],[21.88,21.98,"my"],[22.02,22.22,"class)"],[22.44,22.62,"Rich"],[22.66,22.74,"as"],[22.84,23.18,"hell"],[23.22,23.28,"(Rich"],[23.32,23.34,"as"],[23.38,23.98,"fuck),"],[24.04,24.2,"just"],[24.24,24.28,"to"],[24.44,24.88,"fuck"],[